  # ============================================================
  # Round 4 新发现
  # ============================================================
  - id: R4-N1
    summary: "EDD₀.₇₅=4 的 abstract 无条件陈述缺乏统计支撑——GPT-2 XL bootstrap p=0.505 (non-significant)"
    category: method
    severity: critical
    status: open
    first_raised_round: 4
    last_seen_round: 4
    mentions:
      - round: 4
        reviewers: [1, 2]
        note: "R1 提出 critical，R2 完全同意。Abstract L6 'finding EDD₀.₇₅=4 for extended recursion chains' 是无条件通用陈述，但 §4.4 报告 GPT-2 XL d3v4 AUC=0.750 恰在阈值边界，bootstrap p=0.505。三模型中仅 Pythia (p=0.001) 统计显著，OLMo (p=0.091) marginal。'Graded confidence' 修饰未改变 abstract 中的 overclaim 本质。"
    action_items:
      - round: 4
        action: "Abstract 修改为带统计限定的表述：'EDD₀.₇₅=4 (Pythia, p=0.001; consistent direction across models with graded support)' 或改用 T=0.70 使所有模型均显著"
        assigned_to: paper_agent
        status: open
      - round: 4
        action: "§4.4 脚注更新——'AUC profiles are empirically monotonically decreasing' 已被 Qwen2.5-7B U-shape 和 cross-strategy 反转违反"
        assigned_to: paper_agent
        status: open
    resolution: ""
    resolution_round: null

  - id: R4-N2
    summary: "Zero-shot LLM baseline 是结构性不公平对比——LLM 无法访问 perplexity feature space，'42pp superiority' 是 strawman 论证"
    category: experiment
    severity: critical
    status: open
    first_raised_round: 4
    last_seen_round: 4
    mentions:
      - round: 4
        reviewers: [1, 2]
        note: "R1 提出 critical，R2 完全同意。LLM 读 raw text 时无法获取 reference model perplexity distribution。对比的是 information accessibility 而非 method capability。论文在 §6 Discussion 中反复引用 '42pp superiority' 作为 primary comparison。正确定位应为 'oracle study showing perplexity features are necessary, not surface text'。R2 补充：zero-shot 无 ICL 的 prompt design 进一步降低公平性。"
    action_items:
      - round: 4
        action: "重新定位 LLM baseline：从 'comparison demonstrating superiority' 改为 'ablation showing surface text features are insufficient for depth discrimination'"
        assigned_to: paper_agent
        status: open
      - round: 4
        action: "§6 Discussion 中修改 '42pp' 论述逻辑——不再是 'our method beats LLM' 而是 'depth signal requires statistical feature extraction beyond surface patterns'"
        assigned_to: paper_agent
        status: open
    resolution: ""
    resolution_round: null

  - id: R4-N3
    summary: "Cross-scale '泛化' 声明基于 N=2 个 confound-stacked 的 instruction-tuned 7B 模型，两模型行为完全矛盾"
    category: experiment
    severity: critical
    status: open
    first_raised_round: 4
    last_seen_round: 4
    mentions:
      - round: 4
        reviewers: [1, 2]
        note: "R1 提出 critical，R2 强烈同意。Confounds: (1) 4-bit NF4 QLoRA vs 1.4B standard LoRA (2) instruction-tuned vs base models (3) 500 samples vs 5000 (4) 仅 nucleus。Llama monotonic vs Qwen U-shaped——两个矛盾 data points 无法支撑 'scale generalization'。论文 §5.5 caveats 承认此问题但 abstract/discussion 未反映。"
    action_items:
      - round: 4
        action: "降级 Contribution bullet 3 中 cross-scale 表述：从 'generalization' 改为 'preliminary cross-scale observations with multiple confounds (QLoRA, instruction-tuning, reduced samples)'"
        assigned_to: paper_agent
        status: open
      - round: 4
        action: "§5.4 开头增加显式 confound 清单 + abstract L9 加 qualification"
        assigned_to: paper_agent
        status: open
    resolution: ""
    resolution_round: null

  - id: R4-N4
    summary: "Cross-model recursive chain (84.75%) 存在 architecture-depth confound——高准确率可能部分反映 model identity 而非 pure depth signal"
    category: experiment
    severity: warning
    status: open
    first_raised_round: 4
    last_seen_round: 4
    mentions:
      - round: 4
        reviewers: [1, 2]
        note: "R2 提出，R1 在交叉回应中完全同意（标注为 'R2 指出了我遗漏的重要 confound'）。Heterogeneous chain 设计 (d1=Pythia, d2=OLMo, d3=GPT-2 XL) 将 model identity 与 depth 完全 confound：Pythia reference model 对不同架构的 text 天然产生不同 perplexity profiles，分类器可能利用 architecture fingerprint 而非 depth signal。论文 Contribution bullet 3 claim 'depth signal is a property of the recursive process itself' 可能被此 confound 削弱。要证明 pure depth signal，需 randomize which model generates which depth 或对比 homogeneous vs heterogeneous chain 的 AUC profiles。"
    action_items:
      - round: 4
        action: "在 Appendix cross-boundary 节加入 confound 讨论：(1) 解释为什么 architecture identity 可能 partially explain 84.75% (2) 讨论 AUC profile 是否与 within-model chains 一致作为间接证据"
        assigned_to: paper_agent
        status: open
      - round: 4
        action: "弱化 abstract L8 从 'demonstrating that the depth signal is a property of the recursive process itself' 到 'providing preliminary evidence consistent with a process-level depth signal, though architecture identity is a partial confound'"
        assigned_to: paper_agent
        status: open
    resolution: ""
    resolution_round: null

  - id: R4-W1
    summary: "Curation PoC 全部 rf vs unfiltered 对比 non-significant (p>0.4)——claim 'matches unfiltered with 44% data' 是 null result 非 positive finding"
    category: experiment
    severity: warning
    status: open
    first_raised_round: 4
    last_seen_round: 4
    mentions:
      - round: 4
        reviewers: [1, 2]
        note: "R1 和 R2 独立提出并完全同意。5 seeds (df=4) 统计功效极低。rf vs random 显著可能仅反映 '保留 d0/d1 = 保留更好文本'，binary detection 即可实现。Oracle_strict PPL 反而 worse than unfiltered，说明 depth filtering mechanism 需重新解释。"
    action_items:
      - round: 4
        action: "Discussion 中重新定位 Curation PoC：从 'proof-of-concept' 改为 'inconclusive pilot with insufficient statistical power'; 或增加 seeds 至 ≥20"
        assigned_to: paper_agent
        status: open
    resolution: ""
    resolution_round: null

  - id: R4-W2
    summary: "BOS-seeded 无条件生成降低生态效度——与 prompt-conditioned real-world recursive contamination 有本质区别"
    category: experiment
    severity: warning
    status: open
    first_raised_round: 4
    last_seen_round: 4
    mentions:
      - round: 4
        reviewers: [1, 2]
        note: "R1 提出，R2 initially REBUT（误以为是 prompt-conditioned）但论文 §3.2 明确写 'BOS-seeded, no prompt conditioning'。无条件生成的更高 repetition 和更低 coherence 可能人为放大 depth signal，使 in-distribution accuracy 偏高。Introduction/Discussion 的 deployment framing 与此 controlled setting 存在张力。"
    action_items:
      - round: 4
        action: "在 Limitations 中明确讨论 BOS-seeded vs prompt-conditioned 对 feature distribution 的可能影响"
        assigned_to: paper_agent
        status: open
    resolution: ""
    resolution_round: null

  - id: R4-W3
    summary: "方法论新颖性有限——标准特征 + 标准分类器，无新算法/模型/理论框架"
    category: framing
    severity: warning
    status: open
    first_raised_round: 4
    last_seen_round: 4
    mentions:
      - round: 4
        reviewers: [1, 2]
        note: "R2 列为 critical (N2)，R1 AGREE with caveats——方法层面确实标准 (perplexity features + RF)，但 EMNLP 接收 'novel task + systematic empirical contribution' 型论文。最终共识：不构成 reject 理由但降低 excitement（R1 从 4.0 降至 3.5）。EDD 和 Atlas 是 naming 而非 methodological innovation。如有理论分析连接 model collapse theory 与 perplexity tail encoding depth，可显著提升。"
    action_items:
      - round: 4
        action: "考虑在 Discussion 中加入 2-3 段理论分析：为什么 tail erosion encodes depth（连接 Dohmatob tail-cutting theory），或 formalize perplexity drift rate 与 depth 的关系"
        assigned_to: paper_agent
        status: open
    resolution: ""
    resolution_round: null

